<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">REVE: A Foundation Model for EEG 
<br class="ltx_break">Adapting to Any Setup with 
<br class="ltx_break">Large-Scale Pretraining on 25,000 Subjects</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
