<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Pretraining dataset</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We include a summarized description of the pretraining dataset composition, grouped by category, platform of origin and number of channels. The final dataset spans 61,415 hours of recordings from 92 datasets encompassing 24,274 subjects.</p>
</div>
