<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Ablation on the SSL Method</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The final pretraining hyperparameters were selected based on a series of ablation studies, the results of which are presented in this section.</p>
</div>
